From c5dcced235cf19a87ae50dc70ad163dc71b7accb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 15:16:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Appearance settings: wallpaper with blur/dim, custom
 fonts, color themes

- New Settings > Termux > Appearance screen (wallpaper picker, blur and dim sliders,
  font picker, theme presets, per-color editor)
- Wallpaper drawn in an ImageView behind TerminalView; blur is a one-off stack blur
  on a downscaled copy so it works on every supported API level
- Fonts and colors are written to ~/.termux/font.ttf and colors.properties so the
  GUI stays compatible with hand edits and termux-reload-settings
- TerminalView.setHasContentBehind() so the view is not treated as opaque when a
  wallpaper is showing
